          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher investment in AI funds rapid deployment of port and logistics optimisation systems (berth scheduling, fuel routing, customs automation) in Chinese-controlled hubs, shortening dwell times and increasing the effective throughput of tankers transiting critical chokepoints." />
