          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sustained rise in Chinese AI capital deployment draws both domestic institutional savings and global investment into equity and venture instruments, prompting net redemptions from bond funds as portfolios are reweighted toward higher-growth tech exposure." />
