          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher Chinese private and state AI investment funds development and commercialization of autonomy, ISR analytics and electronic-warfare software that can be transferred, licensed or copied to Russian users, enabling more frequent and effective autonomous/covert strikes and sabotage operations." />
