          <attvalue for="34" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sustained rise in long-term yields raises discount rates and borrowing costs for multi‑year infrastructure projects and increases the hurdle for equity returns, causing Chinese firms and investors to scale back new capital commitments into AI data centres, specialised hardware and long‑lead R&amp;D." />
          <attvalue for="36" value="6-18 months" />
