          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Changes in tanker traffic through chokepoints alter timely delivery of specialty chemicals, high‑purity gases, cooling fluids and diesel backup fuel and equipment for fabs, so reduced tanker flows directly force wafer fabs to cut runs or delay ramp‑ups while restored/increased flows raise chip production throughput." />
